Execution of the sentence imposed on accused Nos.1, 2, 4, 5, 6 and 7 is accordingly suspended and granted bail on their executing a bond for Rs.1,00,000/- (Rupees one lakh only), with two solvent sureties for the like amount each, to the satisfaction of the trial court, subject to the following conditions:
Manu @ Manoj vs State Of Kerala on 15 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/167912685/
3 i) They shall deposit the entire fine amount in the trial court within one month;
ii) They shall not enter the revenue District of Palakkad until further orders;
iii) During the bail period, they shall not get involved in any offence; and Crl.Appeal No.2006 of 2023 & Crl. Appeal Nos.61 and 54 of 2024 iv) They shall not contact or try to intimidate the victim or witnesses examined in the case.

